{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Dragomir: The Dreaming</i></strong><br><i>In the beginning, there was only the Breath\u2026 and from it, all realms were born.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before stars lit the sky, the <strong>Great Winged Mother</strong> and <strong>Orrann</strong>, force of Light, shaped <strong>Dragomir</strong> from the void. A land where elements thrived, life stirred, and shadow waited. Out of a long-forgotten conflict, the <strong>Dytann</strong>\u2014elemental wolves\u2014were created to defend the fragile Dream. You are <strong>Rehocca</strong>, one such wolf, called to uncover ancient truths and confront a growing darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this <strong>old-school high fantasy adventure</strong>, the world is vast, beautiful, and alive with mystery. The Dreaming is just the beginning\u2014a gateway into an epic yet to unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this is no passive tale. <strong>You will shape it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> sprawling environments\u2014from towering ruins and verdant glades to elemental caverns and skybridges.<br><strong>Quest</strong> across branching storylines\u2014meet ancient beings, aid struggling villages, and face corrupted foes.<br><strong>Craft</strong> your survival\u2014gather ingredients, prepare nourishing food, and create enchanted items.<br>Engage in <strong>combat</strong>, both <strong>melee</strong> and <strong>magical</strong>\u2014master elemental strikes and defensive techniques as you battle shadow-touched creatures.<br>Solve <strong>jumping puzzles</strong> and uncover secret pathways where only the nimblest wolves may tread.<br><strong>Collect</strong> lore fragments, rare artifacts, and in-game <strong>achievements</strong> that deepen your connection to the world\u2019s history.<br><strong>Level up</strong> Rehocca\u2019s powers\u2014unlock new abilities like higher level spells and crafting, and evolve your combat style.<br><strong>Save your progress</strong> anytime, allowing for <strong>family-friendly</strong> play\u2014perfect for casual exploration or deep, lore-driven sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step uncovers lost memories, reshapes your path, and weaves you deeper into the Dreaming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dragomir: The Dreaming</strong> invites you to an experience of discovery, challenge, and wonder. As the first chapter of a greater saga, it offers both adventure and a beginning\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And now the Breath stirs again.<br>Will you answer the call?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3785520?t=1773970987","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3785520?t=1773970987","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785520/bce26ada779f82d8ffb2d0e7b0fc40cf9fca15d8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773970987","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785520/bce26ada779f82d8ffb2d0e7b0fc40cf9fca15d8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773970987","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3863370,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Dragomir: The Dreaming</i></strong><br><i>In the beginning, there was only the Breath\u2026 and from it, all realms were born.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before stars lit the sky, the <strong>Great Winged Mother</strong> and <strong>Orrann</strong>, force of Light, shaped <strong>Dragomir</strong> from the void. A land where elements thrived, life stirred, and shadow waited. Out of a long-forgotten conflict, the <strong>Dytann</strong>\u2014elemental wolves\u2014were created to defend the fragile Dream. You are <strong>Rehocca</strong>, one such wolf, called to uncover ancient truths and confront a growing darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this <strong>old-school high fantasy adventure</strong>, the world is vast, beautiful, and alive with mystery. The Dreaming is just the beginning\u2014a gateway into an epic yet to unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this is no passive tale. <strong>You will shape it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> sprawling environments\u2014from towering ruins and verdant glades to elemental caverns and skybridges.<br><strong>Quest</strong> across branching storylines\u2014meet ancient beings, aid struggling villages, and face corrupted foes.<br><strong>Craft</strong> your survival\u2014gather ingredients, prepare nourishing food, and create enchanted items.<br>Engage in <strong>combat</strong>, both <strong>melee</strong> and <strong>magical</strong>\u2014master elemental strikes and defensive techniques as you battle shadow-touched creatures.<br>Solve <strong>jumping puzzles</strong> and uncover secret pathways where only the nimblest wolves may tread.<br><strong>Collect</strong> lore fragments, rare artifacts, and in-game <strong>achievements</strong> that deepen your connection to the world\u2019s history.<br><strong>Level up</strong> Rehocca\u2019s powers\u2014unlock new abilities like higher level spells and crafting, and evolve your combat style.<br><strong>Save your progress</strong> anytime, allowing for <strong>family-friendly</strong> play\u2014perfect for casual exploration or deep, lore-driven sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step uncovers lost memories, reshapes your path, and weaves you deeper into the Dreaming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dragomir: The Dreaming</strong> invites you to an experience of discovery, challenge, and wonder. As the first chapter of a greater saga, it offers both adventure and a beginning\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And now the Breath stirs again.<br>Will you answer the call?</p>","developers":["Four Paws Game Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785520/966cf1bbbfcca4009f5a6a966234c6f0e7bbafe2/header.jpg?t=1773970987","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3785520/2020670062/a79dd38c76865ddbf146e02a495c313d633fca72/1762667792/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762670888","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3785520/2020670062/a79dd38c76865ddbf146e02a495c313d633fca72/1762667792/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762670888","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3785520/2020670062/a79dd38c76865ddbf146e02a495c313d633fca72/1762667792/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762670888","id":257228722,"name":"Dragomir The Dreaming Intro","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257228722/56939e6b6bec9ffed9971b923430d7bf72035c87/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1762670888"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3785520/846253093/78ef415f71c3011aa49464df34deba62c6742abf/1751067491/dash_av1.mpd?t=1751134214","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3785520/846253093/78ef415f71c3011aa49464df34deba62c6742abf/1751067491/dash_h264.mpd?t=1751134214","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3785520/846253093/78ef415f71c3011aa49464df34deba62c6742abf/1751067491/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1751134214","id":257162588,"name":"Dragomir The Dreaming GamePlay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai